data: {"type": "assistant_msg", "ts": "2026-08-06T12:17:54.809562+00:00", "content": "The topology walk from **ce_branch24** (hop 0) traverses the entire network across **9 hops**, revealing a large hub-and-spoke MPLS/SD-WAN fabric. Here's the blast-radius summary:\n\n### Topology Structure\n| Hop | Device Types | Count | Key Observations |\n|-----|--------------|-------|------------------|\n| **0** | **ce_branch24** (source) | 1 | SD-WAN active: latency 103.7 ms, jitter 80.4 ms, loss 0.15% [topo:ce_branch24] |\n| **1** | PE + host VLANs | 3 | **pe12** \u2013 MPLS LDP up, 113 LSPs, 2 BGP peers [topo:pe12]; h_branch24_corp/voice (no metrics) |\n| **2** | CE branch + P routers | 3 | **ce_branch12** (SD-WAN healthy) [topo:ce_branch12]; **p23**, **p24** core P nodes |\n| **3** | PE + P routers + hosts | 5 | **pe11** (MPLS LDP up, 113 LSPs) [topo:pe11]; **p21**, **p22** |\n| **4** | CE branches + P routers | 8 | **ce_branch11**, **ce_branch23** [topo:ce_branch11][topo:ce_branch23]; **p1**, **p2**, **p9**, **p10**, **p17**, **p18** |\n| **5** | P routers + hosts | 16 | **p3\u2013p6**, **p11\u2013p14**, **p19**, **p20** (all MPLS LSPs 107\u2013108, OSPF up) |\n| **6** | P routers + PEs | 11 | **p7**, **p8**, **p15**, **p16**; **pe1**, **pe2**, **pe5**, **pe6**, **pe9**, **pe10** (all BGP peers established, LDP up) |\n| **7** | **All remaining CEs + PEs** | 30 | 24 branch CEs (ce_branch1\u201323 except 11/12/24) [topo:ce_branch1]\u2026[topo:ce_branch22]; 4 DC CEs (ce_dc1\u20134) [topo:ce_dc1]\u2026[topo:ce_dc4]; 6 Hub CEs (ce_hub1\u20136) [topo:ce_hub1]\u2026[topo:ce_hub6]; **pe3**, **pe4**, **pe7**, **pe8** |\n| **8\u20139** | Host VLANs only | 100+ | Corp/voice/guest VLANs for every site (no metrics) |\n\n### Health Highlights (all devices reporting metrics)\n- **All interfaces `ifOperStatus=1` (up)**, zero input errors/discards\n- **MPLS**: LDP session state `5` (operational) on all PEs; LSP counts 107\u2013114 on P/PE nodes\n- **BGP**: Peers established on all PEs (2\u201311 peers each)\n- **OSPF**: Neighbors `1` (full), SPF runs recent\n- **SD-WAN**: Every CE shows `sdwan_path_active=1`; latency 31\u2013112 ms, jitter 13\u201382 ms, loss \u2264 0.36%\n- **Hardware**: Fans ~3000 RPM, temps 24\u201339 \u00b0C, PSU voltages ~11.8\u201311.9 V \u2013 all nominal\n\n### Blast Radius\n**ce_branch24** connects via **pe12** into the MPLS core (p23/p24 \u2192 p21/p22 \u2192 pe11 \u2192 full P-mesh \u2192 all other PEs) reaching **every other branch, data-center, and hub CE** in the network. No device in the metrics path shows faults.\n\n*Citations*: [topo:ce_branch24] [topo:pe12] [topo:ce_branch12] [topo:p23] [topo:p24] [topo:pe11] [topo:p21] [topo:p22] [topo:ce_branch11] [topo:ce_branch23] [topo:p1] [topo:p2] [topo:p9] [topo:p10] [topo:p17] [topo:p18] [topo:p3] [topo:p4] [topo:p5] [topo:p6] [topo:p11] [topo:p12] [topo:p13] [topo:p14] [topo:p19] [topo:p20] [topo:p7] [topo:p8] [topo:p15] [topo:p16] [topo:pe1] [topo:pe2] [topo:pe5] [topo:pe6] [topo:pe9] [topo:pe10] [topo:ce_branch1] [topo:ce_branch2] [topo:ce_branch3] [topo:ce_branch4] [topo:ce_branch5] [topo:ce_branch6] [topo:ce_branch7] [topo:ce_branch8] [topo:ce_branch9] [topo:ce_branch10] [topo:ce_branch13] [topo:ce_branch14] [topo:ce_branch17] [topo:ce_branch18] [topo:ce_branch19] [topo:ce_branch20] [topo:ce_branch21] [topo:ce_branch22] [topo:ce_dc1] [topo:ce_dc2] [topo:ce_dc3] [topo:ce_dc4] [topo:ce_hub1] [topo:ce_hub2] [topo:ce_hub3] [topo:ce_hub4] [topo:ce_hub5] [topo:ce_hub6] [topo:pe3] [topo:pe4] [topo:pe7] [topo:pe8]"}

